; Identifier-occurrence query for A2 (`identifier_occurrences`), Markdown.
;
; Prose has no identifiers. Link labels are the closest thing to a name
; used in two places, but a label is matched by text, not bound, and the
; block grammar sees only part of them (the rest live in the injected
; inline grammar). Intentionally empty, the same shape yaml/locals.scm
; uses.
